strings |id, value|

bug_descriptions |bug_id, line_num, content|
    web_grid_auto_track_takes_full_width_with_flex_item_2026-11-27, 0, "Grid 205px wide, grid-template-columns:auto 1fr; the auto-column item is a div holding display:flex with one 40x20 item at margin-left:10%. Chrome sizes the auto track to its max-content (40px, % margin 0 intrinsically) and 1fr takes the rest, so the item sits at 10% of 40 = 4px."
    web_grid_auto_track_takes_full_width_with_flex_item_2026-11-27, 1, "Chrome 159: k=1 44..79, k=4 176..319. Head (seed fb80903917d6d5f5): k=1 61..100, k=4 242..401 (the auto track is laid out at the full 205px: 10% = 20.5px). grid_track_sizes gives the auto track the container width when its item is a flex container."
    web_grid_auto_track_takes_full_width_with_flex_item_2026-11-27, 2, "Minimal repro (body{margin:0}, .w{margin-left:40px;width:200px;height:30px}, 400x300, measure blue run on CSS row 10): <div class=\"w\" style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;width:205px\"><div><div style=\"display:flex\"><div style=\"margin-left:10%;width:40px;height:20px;background:#00f\"></div></div></div></div>"

